From: petitstrawberry <petitstrawberry.dev@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 20:11:47 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix(native): expose anonymous pipe metadata for fstat

---
 kernel/src/object/capability/file/syscall.rs | 61 ++++++++++---
 tests/native-pipe-metadata/README.md         | 35 ++++++++
 tests/native-pipe-metadata/main.c            | 94 ++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 177 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)
